BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (This handbook summarizes workplace expectations, core employment practices, and the resources available to employees of) Tj T* (DocumentAI, a fictional business-to-business technology company that develops workflow software and provides) Tj T* (technical support services. It applies to regular full-time and part-time employees unless a section says otherwise.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 487.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (This handbook is a practical guide, not an employment contract or a guarantee of employment for any specific period. If a) Tj T* (signed agreement or applicable law provides a different requirement, the agreement or law controls. DocumentAI may revise) Tj T* (policies as business needs and legal requirements change. People Operations maintains the current approved versions.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 463.36 cm
q
.121569 .305882 .47451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3 Tm /F2 12 Tf 15 TL (2. Our workplace principles) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 421.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (DocumentAI expects employees to act with integrity, treat colleagues and customers respectfully, protect confidential information,) Tj T* (and communicate honestly. Employment decisions should be based on role requirements, performance, business needs, and) Tj T* (applicable law.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 367.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 39.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Harassment, discrimination, retaliation, bullying, threats, and abusive conduct are not acceptable. Employees who experience) Tj T* -0.005558 Tw (or witness concerning conduct should report it to their manager or People Operations. Reports will be reviewed promptly and as) Tj T* 0 Tw (confidentially as practical. Retaliation against anyone who raises a good-faith concern or participates in an investigation is) Tj T* (prohibited.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 343.36 cm
q
.121569 .305882 .47451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3 Tm /F2 12 Tf 15 TL (3. Employment classifications and work schedules) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
