q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Employees are classified as full-time, part-time, or temporary and as exempt or non-exempt where applicable. Classification) Tj T* (affects eligibility for certain benefits and the rules governing timekeeping and overtime. The offer letter and HR system record) Tj T* (the employee's classification.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 247.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 39.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Standard office collaboration hours are 9:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m. Pacific Time, Monday through Friday. Individual schedules may) Tj T* -0.075429 Tw (vary by team, customer coverage, and approved remote-work arrangements. Non-exempt employees must accurately record all) Tj T* 0 Tw (hours worked and obtain manager approval before working overtime when practicable. All hours actually worked must still be) Tj T* (recorded and will be paid in accordance with applicable law.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 223.36 cm
q
.121569 .305882 .47451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3 Tm /F2 12 Tf 15 TL (4. Attendance, communication, and conduct) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 193.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 15.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Employees should arrive ready to work at their scheduled start time and notify their manager as soon as possible if they will be) Tj T* (late or absent. For planned absences, employees should provide advance notice and follow the applicable leave procedure.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 151.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Use professional language in person, in email, chat, video meetings, and customer interactions. Keep calendars current, attend) Tj T* (required meetings, and provide timely status updates. Employees should not make commitments on behalf of DocumentAI unless) Tj T* (authorized to do so.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
