q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 15.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Pay frequency, pay rate, and applicable deductions are communicated during hiring and through payroll records. Employees) Tj T* (should review each pay statement and promptly report suspected errors to People Operations.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 67.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 15.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Non-exempt employees must record start times, end times, and unpaid meal periods using the approved timekeeping system.) Tj T* (Do not record time for another employee or ask another employee to record time for you. Corrections should be submitted with) Tj T* ET
